{"ID":"20240205153649-cdfjwys","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153649-cdfjwys","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153649-cdfjwys\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206085358-et2r31f\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240612183658-c4wretw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:444,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240628102945-4qinwso\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"272桔梗","type":"doc","updated":"20240822163241"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206085358-et2r31f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206085358-et2r31f","updated":"20240206085402"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产华北、东北等地。\n【性状】\t根长圆形或长纺锤形，稍扭曲，下部偶有分支，长620cm，直径12cm。表面淡黄白色或淡黄棕色 (未去栓皮者)，皱缩，有扭转的纵沟及横长的皮孔斑痕，上部有横纹；顶端芦头 (根茎) 长0.5"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4cm，有半月形凹陷的茎痕，呈盘节状。质坚实，横断面淡黄色，角质样，形成层环棕色，皮部有稀少放射状裂隙，木部较紧密。气微，味微甜后苦。饮片性状：桔梗为不规则圆形厚片，表面白色或淡黄白色，有一浅棕色环，周边呈淡黄白色，有皱纹。无臭，味微甜后苦。蜜桔梗，形如桔梗生片，表面淡黄色至淡棕黄色，滋润，微具蜜糖香气。味甜而后苦。\n【性味】\t苦、辛，平。\n【功效】\t宣肺、祛痰、利咽、排脓、利五脏、补气血、补五劳、养气。主治咳嗽痰多、咽喉肿痛、肺痈吐脓、胸满胁痛、痢疾腹痛、口舌生疮、目赤肿痛、小便癃闭。\n【注解】\t“金井玉栏”：指药材的断面，中心木部呈淡黄色 (金井)，皮部为白色 (玉栏)，合称金井玉栏。\n“芦头”：指药材顶端带有的盘结状短根茎。\n“芦碗”：指芦头上的数个圆形或半圆形凹窝状的已枯萎茎痕，形状如小碗。"}]},{"ID":"20240206085351-9p1mywf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206085351-9p1mywf","updated":"20240206085351"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206085351-9qmnc6q.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205163937-y3bn7vm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205163937-y3bn7vm","updated":"20240205163937"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"桔梗"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/桔梗-20240205163937-q571x97.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205163937-k39zqs2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205163937-k39zqs2","updated":"20240205163937"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"桔梗2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/桔梗2-20240205163937-72rdoiw.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]}]},{"ID":"20240628101931-6klmsyg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240628101931-6klmsyg","updated":"20240628102051"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 328px;","style":"width: 318px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"桔梗"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/桔梗-20240628101931-ly2y4f7.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 318px;\" parent-style=\"width: 328px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 395px;","style":"width: 385px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240628102033-1km2c9s.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 385px;\" parent-style=\"width: 395px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"s